{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在無綫節目《流行都市》的「睇餸食飯」環節中，Kobe鄭紫欣為大家示範了一道既簡單又下飯的家常佳餚——「醬香肉碎豆腐飯」。這道料理步驟清晰，醬汁濃郁，非常適合忙碌的都市人。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">醬香肉碎豆腐飯所需材料</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">調味：米酒 1蓋</p></li><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芡汁：生粉 1茶匙、清水 2湯匙</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">烹飪步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\" style=\"caret-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"82494cd0-9479-4c0c-b843-e836d16faeb1.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/file/2026/07/2026Uf7MULS8Ks1784261062.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"82494cd0-9479-4c0c-b843-e836d16faeb1.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-20T13:05:05.922157+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}